  "id": 229,
  "title": "医院的数字孪生体，助力院方高效管理",
  "date": "2023-05-23",
  "summary": "在新兴技术的助推下，智慧医院、移动智慧医院、互联网+智慧医院、大数据、远程智慧医院与智能可穿戴设备在智慧医院行业的应用逐渐增多。",
  "abstract": null,
  "category": "公司动态",
  "href": "/information/detail-229.html",
  "image": "https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2023-5-23/20235231547397374.png",
  "author": "古河云科技",
  "content": "<p style=\"margin:5px 0;\"><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;\"><img src=\"https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2023-5-23/2023523154837727.png\" title=\"微信截图_20230523154720\" alt=\"微信截图_20230523154720\" /><br /><br /><br /></span></p><p style=\"margin:5px 0;\"><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;\">随着我国</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">智慧医院</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;\">水平的逐步提高，国家对</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">智慧医院</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;\">的重视程度越来越高。</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">医院</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;\">机构传统的管理模式很难支撑高速发展的需要，</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;\">需</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;\">采用数字化的管理方式，为医院管理提速。</span></p><p style=\"margin:5px 0;\"><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;\">新型的智慧医院</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">需满足各个智慧医院系统的协调统一，预警及时处理，智慧医院</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;\">管理者也希望通过信息化手段提高管理效率。医院逐渐向智能化的方向转型，在新兴技术的助推下，智慧医院、移动</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">智慧医院</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">、互联网</span>+</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">智慧医院</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;\">、大数据</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">、</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;\">远程</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">智慧医院</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;\">与智能可穿戴设备在</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">智慧医院</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;\">行业</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">的应用逐渐增多</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;\">。</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">过于</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;\">分散的设备环境、</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">不断</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;\">演变的平台架构以及</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">巨量</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;\">的数据分析都将通过</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">数字孪生</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;\">技术向数字化</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">智慧医院</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;\">转型。</span></p><p style=\"margin:5px 0;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">采用</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;\">SaaS</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">平台搭建的智慧医院系统</span></span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;\">，围绕</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">智慧医院</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;\">看板、科室监测、医院园区等模块进行展示。使</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">院内</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;\">原本独立的各</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">个</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;\">系统根据各自</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">的</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;\">特性形成联动预案与管理</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">的</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;\">一体化。</span></p><p style=\"margin:5px 0;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">将医院的整体场景以写实风格呈现</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;\">，通过对医院内建筑、道路等进行</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">可视化</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">三维建模，结合丰富的</span> 2D<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">、</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;\">3D </span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">组态，仿真还原了</span></span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">智慧</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;\">医院</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">的</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;\">整体</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">场景</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;\">与数据</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">分析</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;\">。</span></p><p style=\"margin:5px 0;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">采用漫游的形式</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">，支持</span> 360 <span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">度全方位无死角浏览</span></span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">智慧园区</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">。同时也支持跨平台浏览，任何移动终端均可轻松打开，这是</span> C <span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">端平台所不具备的优势</span></span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">。</span></p><p style=\"margin:5px 0;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">将数据</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;\">可视化与园区管理系统相结合，</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">实现智慧医院的数字孪生，</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;\">接入园区管理数据至可视化平台，实时更新园区内占地面积、标准床位数</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">、</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;\">楼宇数及科室数等信息以及院内人员在社区卫生服务中心的坐诊情况。</span></p><p style=\"margin:5px 0;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">智慧医院</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;\">服务系统，</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">为</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;\">一般疾病的基本治疗</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">提供辅助，让患者享受更舒适的诊疗服务</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;\">。</span></p><p style=\"margin:5px 0;\"><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:14px\"> </span></p><p><br /></p>",
